e productos", "content": "Somos una pequeña panadería en Managua buscando socios para ampliar nuestra red de distribución. Ofrecemos productos frescos de calidad.", "image": "posts/post_1_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.483Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.139Z", "upvotes": 18, "downvotes": 2, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 2, "fields": {"title": "Ofertas de artesanías tradicionales", "content": "Vendemos artesanías hechas a mano en Estelí. Ideales para regalos corporativos y souvenirs turísticos.", "image": "posts/post_2_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 2, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.547Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.129Z", "upvotes": 22, "downvotes": 1, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 3, "fields": {"title": "Servicios de desarrollo web y consultoría IT", "content": "Ofrecemos servicios profesionales de desarrollo web, aplicaciones móviles y consultoría tecnológica para PyMEs.", "image": "posts/post_3_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 3, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.609Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.121Z", "upvotes": 30, "downvotes": 0, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 4, "fields": {"title": "Café de especialidad: cosecha de la temporada", "content": "Estrenamos nuestra cosecha de café de altura. Grading 84+. Pedidos para exportación y mercado local.", "image": "posts/post_4_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 4, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.667Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.112Z", "upvotes": 45, "downvotes": 0, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 5, "fields": {"title": "Nueva línea de textiles con diseños nicaragüenses", "content": "Lanzamos línea de ropa con bordados tradicionales de la región.", "image": "posts/post_5_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 5, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.730Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.103Z", "upvotes": 28, "downvotes": 1, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 6, "fields": {"title": "Pan artesanal recién horneado cada mañana", "content": "En Panadería Nicaragüeña horneamos pan artesanal todos los días. Pedidos por mayor y detal en Managua.", "image": "posts/post_6_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 1, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.795Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.094Z", "upvotes": 12, "downvotes": 1, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 7, "fields": {"title": "Exposición de cerámica tradicional de Estelí", "content": "Los invitamos a nuestra exposición de cerámica y barro negro. Hecho 100% a mano por artesanos locales.", "image": "posts/post_7_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 2, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.855Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.086Z", "upvotes": 9, "downvotes": 0, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 8, "fields": {"title": "Consultoría tributaria: evita multas de la DGI", "content": "Asesoramos a PyMEs en cumplimiento tributario. Diagnóstico gratuito inicial.", "image": "posts/post_8_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 8, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.899Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.077Z", "upvotes": 55, "downvotes": 0, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 9, "fields": {"title": "Buscamos tiendas aliadas para vender artesanías", "content": "Queremos expandir nuestra cerámica de barro negro a más puntos de venta en Managua y Granada. Buscamos tiendas aliadas que quieran exhibir nuestros productos.", "image": "posts/post_9_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 2, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T22:09:38.684Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.069Z", "upvotes": 0, "downvotes": 0, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 10, "fields": {"title": "Alianzas tecnológicas: desarrollamos tu tienda en línea", "content": "Buscamos PyMEs aliadas para lanzar una red de tiendas en línea. Ofrecemos desarrollo web y comercio electrónico a costo preferencial a cambio de participación en ventas o referencia mutua.", "image": "posts/post_10_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 3, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T22:10:24.799Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.059Z", "upvotes": 27, "downvotes": 0, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 11, "fields": {"title": "Buscamos cafeterías aliadas para café de especialidad", "content": "Producimos café de altura de Jinotega (Grading 84+). Buscamos cafeterías en Managua, Granada y León que quieran ofrecer nuestro grano en sus menús.", "image": "posts/post_11_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 4, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T22:10:24.851Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.047Z", "upvotes": 41, "downvotes": 0, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 12, "fields": {"title": "Alianza con boutiques para ropa con bordados tradicionales", "content": "Fabricamos ropa con bordados nicaragüenses. Buscamos boutiques y tiendas de moda aliadas para vender nuestra línea en sus locales.", "image": "posts/post_12_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 5, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T22:10:24.896Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.037Z", "upvotes": 19, "downvotes": 0, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 13, "fields": {"title": "Buscamos socios para distribución de lácteos", "content": "Nuestra finca produce queso fresco y lácteos artesanales. Buscamos distribuidores o pulperías aliadas para llegar a más zonas de León y Chinandega.", "image": "posts/post_13_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 6, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T22:10:24.935Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.027Z", "upvotes": 24, "downvotes": 0, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 14, "fields": {"title": "Alianza con productores para transporte de mercadería", "content": "Buscamos productores agrícolas y artesanos que necesiten transporte de carga nacional. Tarifas preferenciales para alianzas a largo plazo.", "image": "posts/post_14_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 7, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T22:10:24.987Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.017Z", "upvotes": 15, "downvotes": 0, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.post", "pk": 15, "fields": {"title": "Alianza para asesoría legal a PyMEs", "content": "Ofrecemos paquetes de asesoría legal y tributaria a empresas muy pequeñas. Buscamos gremios y agrupaciones de PyMEs aliadas para llegar a más emprendedores.", "image": "posts/post_15_prod.jpg", "video": "", "author": 8, "timestamp": "2026-09-01T22:10:25.046Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T22:22:27.002Z", "upvotes": 33, "downvotes": 0, "moderation_status": "approved", "moderation_reason": null}}, {"model": "social.vote", "pk": 1, "fields": {"user": 2, "post": 1, "vote_type": "up", "created_at": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.958Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.958Z"}}, {"model": "social.vote", "pk": 2, "fields": {"user": 3, "post": 1, "vote_type": "up", "created_at": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.964Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.964Z"}}, {"model": "social.vote", "pk": 3, "fields": {"user": 4, "post": 1, "vote_type": "up", "created_at": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.971Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.971Z"}}, {"model": "social.vote", "pk": 4, "fields": {"user": 1, "post": 2, "vote_type": "up", "created_at": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.977Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.978Z"}}, {"model": "social.vote", "pk": 5, "fields": {"user": 3, "post": 2, "vote_type": "up", "created_at": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.983Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-01T20:45:37.983Z"}}, {"model": "social.vote", "pk": 6, 